nodecode-storm is a rewrite of bmtrnavsky's bmtrnavsky/storm-fusion-research-pipeline:
https://github.com/bmtrnavsky/storm-fusion-research-pipeline
commit b1a492eb9cfd41b120db8ac6d8a97128901b87d2
